        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The time for a service request begins when the employee contacts Dispatch acknowledging the service request and ends when employee returns home and contacts Dispatch. Employee must also contact Dispatch when arriving at downed vehicle. Employees must be able to reach downed vehicle within 60 minutes after initial contact with Dispatch.",
